5. Method
5.1 Selecting Collectors
Since DHH is primarily concerned with the folktales in the MMC, the project also offers the Dúchas digitisation project a system for prioritising the transcription of material from the MMC, which consists of c.700k pages.9 In conjunction with the team in the National Folklore Collection in UCD, a list was drawn up of the most prolific field workers involved in the collection of seanscéalta, the narrative form that is to be the core focus of the DHH project.

